    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Your donation form is the heartbeat of fundraising on your website — so why settle for solutions that don’t perform?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://intro.fundy.cloud\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dekode Fundraising</a> puts the donor experience first.</p>\n<h3>Dekode Fundraising is fast</h3>\n<p>Set up a donation form in under a minute, no developers needed.</p>\n<h3>Seamless payment &amp; CRM integrations</h3>\n<p>Works with Vipps, Nets, AvtaleGiro and more, connects to ProFundo, SalesForce and Dynamics.</p>\n<h3>Dekode Fundraising converts</h3>\n<p>Built on years of experience in nonprofit fundraising, Dekode Fundraising removes friction and makes your content shine.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to an API to facilitate the fundraising functionality, both to show forms and to handle submissions.</p>\n<p>It sends users personal data (manually entered into a form) when they submit a form.</p>\n<p>This service is provided by &#8220;Dekode Fundraising&#8221;: <a href=\"https://fundy.cloud/en/page/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">privacy policy</a>.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='do%20i%20need%20a%20dekode%20fundraising%20account%3F'>\nDo I need a Dekode Fundraising account?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, this plugin requires a <a href=\"https://intro.fundy.cloud\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dekode Fundraising</a> subscription to use.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.2.1 (2025-08-22)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial WordPress.org release.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.3.0 (2025-12-02)</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reintroduce translation files.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Dekode Fundraising is the fundraising engine that actually converts",
    "description": "<p>Your donation form is the heartbeat of fundraising on your website — so why settle for solutions that don’t perform?</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://intro.fundy.cloud\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Dekode Fundraising</a> puts the donor experience first.</p>\n<h3>Dekode Fundraising is fast</h3>\n<p>Set up a donation form in under a minute, no developers needed.</p>\n<h3>Seamless payment &amp; CRM integrations</h3>\n<p>Works with Vipps, Nets, AvtaleGiro and more, connects to ProFundo, SalesForce and Dynamics.</p>\n<h3>Dekode Fundraising converts</h3>\n<p>Built on years of experience in nonprofit fundraising, Dekode Fundraising removes friction and makes your content shine.</p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin connects to an API to facilitate the fundraising functionality, both to show forms and to handle submissions.</p>\n<p>It sends users personal data (manually entered into a form) when they submit a form.</p>\n<p>This service is provided by &#8220;Dekode Fundraising&#8221;: <a href=\"https://fundy.cloud/en/page/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">privacy policy</a>.</p>\n",
